    "preamble": "Subhash Onkar Jagtap And Another vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 6 December, 2022 Author: S.G. Mehare Bench: S.G. Mehare 1937.22BA.odt 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 937 Bail Application No.1937 Of 2022 1. Subhash Onkar Jagtap Age : 65 years, Occ : Cleaner, R/o Plot no.8, Daulat Nagar, Jalgaon. 2. Shaikh Riyaz Shaikh Fattu Age : 25 years, occ : Driver, R/o Near Madina Masjid, Ambika Nagar, Mukundwadi, Aurangabad. ..Applicants -Versus- 1. The State of Maharashtra Through Police Inspector, Midc Cidco Police Station, Aurangabad, Tq. & Dist. Aurangabad 2. Commissioner of Police Commissioner Office, Aurangabad. ..Respondents ... Mr.A.R. Borulkar, advocate for applicants. Mr.S.B. Narwade, App for the respondents/State. ... Coram : S.G. Mehare, J. Date : December 06, 2022 Per Court :- . Heard the learned counsel for the applicants and the learned App for respondents/State. Subhash Onkar Jagtap And Another vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 6 December, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/8982323/ 1 2 . The applicants have been arrested for illegal business of scented tobacco.",
